  "prefLabel": "We 206.02 Time for Filing of Appeals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 206.02 Time for Filing of Appeals. Any appeal shall be filed within 30 days of the date the decision being appealed was issued. As specified in We 202.04, the appeal shall be deemed to have been filed on the date it is received by the board.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9178-A, eff 6-13-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
